# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is PRIVATE NOW and PUBLIC LATER. Treat every commit as public.
#
# The ordinary secret risk (tokens, keys) is covered below, but the sharper
# risk for this project is different: the status engine reads a LIVE fleet
# doing real business work. Pane titles, transcripts and session state can
# contain client names, financial work, email and calendar content.
#
# That is not credential-shaped, so a secrets scanner will not catch it.
# Rules, in order of importance:
#   1. Fixtures are SYNTHETIC or redacted. Never a captured slice of live state.
#   2. Anything captured from the real fleet lives OUTSIDE this repo.
#   3. Screenshots of live data go to Discord or the private vault, never here.
#      Agent names plus task lines are already a business disclosure.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Captured live state — never commit
/captured/
*.live.json
*.capture.json
*-live-*.png
snapshot-*.json

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# Local
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
